<title>USA: RISCORP says Zenith to buy it.</title>
<headline>RISCORP says Zenith to buy it.</headline>
<dateline>SARASOTA, Fla. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>RISCORP Inc said on Tuesday Zenith National Insurance Corp has agreed to acquire substantially all the assets of Riscorp and its affiliates.</p>
<p>Zenith will pay the difference at closing between the book value of the assets purchased and the liabilities assumed by Zenith, or at least $35 million cash, RISCORP said.</p>
<p>Zenith also has agreed to reinsure all new and renewed RISCORP policies issued after today.</p>
<p>The assets of all RISCORP insurance-related subsidiaries are involved in the transaction, the company said.</p>
</text>
